# Chromium security update pending in Debian bookworm.
#
# Debian's security tracker records these as resolved in
# chromium 151.0.7922.169-1~deb12u1, but that build is not published to
# bookworm-security yet — the archive still carries 151.0.7922.137-1~deb12u1,
# so the Dockerfile pin cannot move and `ignore-unfixed` does not apply.
#
# Affects chromium, chromium-common and chromium-sandbox (33 findings).
#
# When 151.0.7922.169-1~deb12u1 lands: bump CHROME_VERSION,
# CHROMIUM_PACKAGE_VERSION and DEBIAN_SNAPSHOT in the Dockerfile, update the
# two 151.0.7922.137 assertions in the "Verify deployment runtime metadata"
# step of .github/workflows/quality.yml, then delete this file. The expiry
# dates below re-break the build if that has not happened, rather than letting
# the exception go stale silently.
